IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTDECODE-MICRO.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ACTIVE-SEQS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 MICRO-BATCH         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HIDDEN-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BATCHES-PROCESSED   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTDECODE-MICRO.
    IF MICRO-BATCH == 0 OR HIDDEN-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE ACTIVE-SEQS TO BATCHES-PROCESSED.
    DIVIDE MICRO-BATCH INTO BATCHES-PROCESSED.
    IF BATCHES-PROCESSED == 0
        MOVE 1 TO BATCHES-PROCESSED.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 BATCHES-PROCESSED.
    WEIGHT 30 MICRO-BATCH.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
